{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109973","id":2773238037,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6lTEEV","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109973","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109973.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109973.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109973","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109973/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109973/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109973/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0831b4b516366a863b4ba041eeb1558bdfc9298f","number":109973,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Make shader editor menu position consistent between shader languages","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR fixes #109866, and mostly undoes PR #105183.\r\n\r\nThe behavior is now that the top menu bar exists above the edited shader, not above the list of files. This prevents the list of files from jumping up and down when switching between shaders of different languages.\r\n\r\nThe code is significantly simplified. There was some really bad logic in the general shader editor code which violated the scope of its responsibility. For example, the general shader editor not only knew specifically about visual shaders, but also knew about *specific indices inside of the visual shader editor's menu toolbar*:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nvoid ShaderEditorPlugin::_switch_to_editor(ShaderEditor *p_editor) {\r\n\tControl *bar = p_editor->get_top_bar();\r\n\r\n\tVisualShaderEditor *vs_editor = Object::cast_to<VisualShaderEditor>(p_editor);\r\n\tif (vs_editor) {\r\n\t\tfile_menu->get_parent()->remove_child(file_menu);\r\n\t\tfile_menu->set_switch_on_hover(false);\r\n\t\tbar->add_child(file_menu);\r\n\t\tbar->move_child(file_menu, 2); // Toggle Files Panel button + separator.\r\n\r\n\t\tmake_floating->get_parent()->remove_child(make_floating);\r\n\t\tbar->add_child(make_floating);\r\n\t} else {\r\n\t\t// a dozen more lines...\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis PR removes `Control *get_top_bar()` and replaces this with a new API, `use_menu_bar_items`, called like this:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nvoid ShaderEditorPlugin::_switch_to_editor(ShaderEditor *p_editor) {\r\n\tif (file_menu->get_parent() != nullptr) {\r\n\t\tfile_menu->get_parent()->remove_child(file_menu);\r\n\t}\r\n\tif (make_floating->get_parent() != nullptr) {\r\n\t\tmake_floating->get_parent()->remove_child(make_floating);\r\n\t}\r\n\tp_editor->use_menu_bar_items(file_menu, make_floating);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe language-specific code is very short, and entirely self-contained in those editors:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nvoid VisualShaderEditor::use_menu_bar_items(MenuButton *p_file_menu, Button *p_make_floating) {\r\n\tp_file_menu->set_switch_on_hover(false);\r\n\ttoolbar_hflow->add_child(p_file_menu);\r\n\ttoolbar_hflow->move_child(p_file_menu, 2); // Toggle Files Panel button + separator.\r\n\ttoolbar_hflow->add_child(p_make_floating);\r\n}\r\n```","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1609442062,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjA5NDQyMDYy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:shaders","name":"topic:shaders","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","fo